{"id":"9950d502a3a677fa","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-free-variable.md","title":"自由变量","display":"df-free-variable — 自由变量","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-free-variable","aliases":["56-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — 自由变量","depends_on":["[[56-df-formula]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — 自由变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c94545e8fa521ff\" href=\"?note=1c94545e8fa521ff\" title=\"56-df-formula\">56-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 及公式构造器见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c94545e8fa521ff\" href=\"?note=1c94545e8fa521ff\" title=\"56-df-formula\">56-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>项变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。关系原子分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\vec t\">\\(P,\\vec t\\)</span> 在断言内有界量化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t_i\">\\(\\vec t_i\\)</span> 为序列分量；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_L=\\varnothing\">\\(P_L=\\varnothing\\)</span>。下列方程按有限公式构造树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V)=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal V:|X|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V)=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal V:|X|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}:\\mathrm{Form}_L\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}:\\mathrm{Form}_L\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\mathrm{free}(P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\mathrm{Var}(\\vec t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\mathrm{free}(P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\mathrm{Var}(\\vec t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每次递归只调用严格较小的公式，覆盖全部构造子。旧文 free(φ):=φ 的类型错误已删除，等式与存在量词分支已补齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 及公式构造器见 [[56-df-formula]]；$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$，$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"项变量函数 $\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。关系原子分支的 $P,\\vec t$ 在断言内有界量化，$\\vec t_i$ 为序列分量；允许 $P_L=\\varnothing$。下列方程按有限公式构造树递归；$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V)=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal V:|X|<\\aleph_0\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t_i","display":false},{"tex":"P_L=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V)=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal V:|X|<\\aleph_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}:\\mathrm{Form}_L\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\n\\mathrm{free}(P(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\mathrm{Var}(\\vec t_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{free}(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1974,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定语言 $L$ 的公式集合及自由变量函数，见 [[56-df-free-variable]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-free-variable.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1c94545e8fa521ff","491e726b9c1f42b0"]}